msgstr "Los mismos valores se pueden definir en wp-config.php con las constantes ICC_GG_SUPER_CACHE_VARNISH_ENABLED, ICC_GG_SUPER_CACHE_VARNISH_HOST, ICC_GG_SUPER_CACHE_VARNISH_PORT, ICC_GG_SUPER_CACHE_VARNISH_KEY e ICC_GG_SUPER_CACHE_VARNISH_AUTO_PURGE."

#. translators: 1: plugin name, 2: required PHP version, 3: current PHP version.
